*** Test Cases ***
CB008015-ET-A18_A_B4_Blind scell selection based on different weighted scell bandwidth
    [Documentation]
    ...    1. The purpose of this test case is to check SCell selection based on differ weight for SA call.
    ...       UE 81: support full n66+n71;n71+n41;n66+n41;n66+n78; n41+n78;n71+n78;n66+n66+n71 CA
    ...       Final selection order in cell2 > cell1 > (cell12 + cell13) > cell13  > cell12
    ...    2. Test Case Steps:
    ...       precondition : rsrp
    ...         a. SA UE-81 attached in cell 11.start data transfer.Blind SCell addition is triggered for  SA UE-81
    ...         b. Release the call and lock cell 2, make a new call.Blind SCell addition is triggered for SA UE-81
    ...         c. Release the call and lock cell 1, make a new call.Blind SCell addition is triggered for SA UE-81
    ...         d. Release the call and unlock Cell 2 and Cell 1.
    ...    3. Expected Results:
    ...         Step a: Cell2 is added as scell.
    ...         Step b: Cell1 is added as scell
    ...         Step c: Cell13 cell12 is added as scell.
    ...         Step d: Call release successfully.
